// New features tour: one document exercising every Phase 1-3 addition.
// It must compile with zero errors (check the final status line).
*doc_title(New Features Tour)

# Text styling

*bold(Important ideas) stand out, *italic(emphasis) adds tone,
and *underline(key terms) mark vocabulary.

Short forms: *b(bold), *i(italic), *u(underline).

Nesting works: *bold(outer *italic(inner) outer).

Variables and calculations work inside styling:

<n> = 3
*bold(answer is calc(<n> * 2))

Math works inside too: *bold(*frac(1 ; 2)).

# Numbers and sets

Real numbers: *RR, naturals: *NN, integers: *ZZ, rationals: *QQ, complex: *CC.

Long forms: *reals *naturals *integers *rationals *complex.

The solution is \ x *isin *RR \.

*matrix(*NN ; *ZZ | *QQ ; *CC)

# Accents and derivatives

*hat(x) + *bar(y) + *tilde(z) + *dot(w)

Segment AB: *overline(AB)

First derivative: *diff(x^2 ; x)

Second derivative: *diff(x^2 ; x ; 2)

Partial derivative: *pdiff(f ; x)

# Determinants and sets

*det(1 ; 2 | 3 ; 4)

*det(*matrix(2 ; 5 | 1 ; 3))

Builder notation: *set(x ; x > 0)

Listing notation: *set(1 ; 2 ; 3)

Two elements use commas: *set(a, b)

# Aligned equations

*align(x + y = 3 | x - y = 1)

*align(
    x = 1
    y = 2
)

# Calculations with functions

calc(sqrt(16)) and calc(sin(0)) and calc(2 * pi).

<root> = calc(sqrt(16))
The square root of 16 is <root>.

# Page break and image

*newpage

After the break: a sine wave.

*image(sine.png ; 70%)
